==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|bine}}, from {{inh|de|goh|bini}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*biniz}}, representing an ''-n-'' variant of Germanic {{m|gem-pro|*bijō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈbiːnə/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Biene.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Bienen|Bienchen|dim2=Bienlein}}

# [[bee]]
#: Biene Maja - (famous children's tale about a bee called Maja)
# {{lb|de|colloquial}} cute, sexy woman
#: {{uxi|de|flotte Biene|cute, sexy woman}}

